-        "A JSON list of c pairwise-distinct integers; entry r is an A_mu class "
-        "label with 2 <= mu <= q for displayed component r."
-    ),
-    "bounds": {
-        "length": "the displayed component count c (at most 64)",
-        "entry_min": 2,
-        "entry_max": "the displayed prime q",
-        "structural_rule": "all entries are pairwise distinct",
-    },
